ure","src":"images/e4e53b99f96ff6a342cbd35ce88b6619dd7da7f489d1851451d2da48417928c0.png","width":335,"height":292,"width_mm":39.27,"row_group":"z20-lianmeng-2512-q11-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图丁\n第11题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 图甲中，a 是金属热电阻的图线"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 图乙中，a 是温度较低时的图线"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 图丙中，b 是温度较高时的图线"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 图丁中，b 是温度较低时的图线"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"AD","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--z20-lianmeng-2512-q12","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--z20-lianmeng-2512","source_question_id":"z20-lianmeng-2512-q12","number":"12","order":12,"type":"多选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"d369d33ffaa79930ed3b1d1c9b643052f4b549c3fad43bb30eef0a44b3590931","body":[{"type":"text","value":"12. 如图 1 所示，在空旷的广场上，将音箱甲、乙分别放置在相距 1 米的等高位置 "},{"type":"math","value":"S_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 和 "},{"type":"math","value":"S_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 处。一个固定频率的音频信号同时送入两个音箱，两个音箱发出的声音形成干涉。将手机检测软件打开，在 "},{"type":"math","value":"S_{1}S_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 连线上中点附近的 "},{"type":"math","value":"40 \\mathrm{~cm}"},{"type":"text","value":" 范围内匀速移动，测得振幅分布如图 2 所示。空气中的声速大约为 "},{"type":"math","value":"340 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。下列说法正确的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/db03f5cc616802007e0417b3044b52484a89d89ed04b483ea56d7847634ad854.png","width":431,"height":234,"width_mm":50.61,"row_group":"z20-lianmeng-2512-q12-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 12 题图 1\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/3ad7cc72298b5ffbbf1f537011e0915427debb8fb5fdb746ca3df83d55036ac3.png","width":510,"height":239,"width_mm":59.85,"row_group":"z20-lianmeng-2512-q12-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 12 题图 2\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. "},{"type":"math","value":"S_{1}S_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 连线的中垂面上各点振幅相等"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 在线段 "},{"type":"math","value":"S_{1}S_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 上分布有5个振幅峰"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 声音的频率大约是 "},{"type":"math","value":"850\\mathrm{Hz}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 让音箱乙在 "},{"type":"math","value":"S_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 附近挥舞，两个声音仍能形成干涉"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"BC","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--z20-lianmeng-2512-q13","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--z20-lianmeng-2512","source_question_id":"z20-lianmeng-2512-q13","number":"13","order":13,"type":"多选题","topics":["近代物理"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"3dece5f047aada69e8994a170abca5c1ee1188de60fda32afd0f463926b76059","body":[{"type":"text","value":"13. 如图 1 所示，一定频率的光照射到某金属材料表面。改变频率，可能发生光电效应或者康普顿效应。图 2 为康普顿效应示意图。已知普朗克常量 "},{"type":"math","value":"h = 6.6 \\times 10^{-34} \\, \\text{J} \\cdot \\text{s}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，真空中的光速 "},{"type":"math","value":"c = 3.0 \\times 10^{8} \\, \\text{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，元电荷 "},{"type":"math","value":"e = 1.6 \\times 10^{-19} \\, \\text{C}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。下列说法正确的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/ccf2154098fd78c16eeb7cae2a06d48ab19033fc1ff70058f50b745607137571.png","width":151,"height":253,"width_mm":17.64,"row_group":"z20-lianmeng-2512-q13-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 13 题图 1\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/0a758e50be8d54a4f461dddef2351435f30a24654d5e2b330db2841b1eeadc03.png","width":517,"height":243,"width_mm":60.69,"row_group":"z20-lianmeng-2512-q13-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第13题图2\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 若发生光电效应，仅增加光强，光电子的初动能增加"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 若发生康普顿效应，与入射光子比，散射光子的速度和动量都减小"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 若发生光电效应，且入射光子的能量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"7.1\\mathrm{eV}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，光电子的最大初动能为 "},{"type":"math","value":"0.5\\mathrm{eV}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，则该材料的截止频率为 "},{"type":"math","value":"1.6\\times 10^{15}\\mathrm{Hz}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 若发生康普顿效应，且入射光子的能量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"7.1\\mathrm{keV}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，电子的能量增加 "},{"type":"math","value":"0.5\\mathrm{keV}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，则散射光波长增量的数量级为 "},{"type":"math","value":"10^{-11}\\mathrm{m}"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"CD","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--z20-lianmeng-2512-q14","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--z20-lianmeng-2512","source_question_id":"z20-lianmeng-2512-q14","number":"14","order":14,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学","电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"4cf5388b45fc21a6a58035bff2ca81153e532a77f74fde1f07f10eb69fbe25b5","body":[{"type":"text","value":"14. I（5 分）某同学在 “研究气垫导轨上滑块碰撞时的动量守恒” 实验中，实验装置如图 1 所示。调平气垫导轨，利用数字计时器和光电门测量滑块碰撞前后的速度。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/05b36e815b98d6691cf04db608788cae08b7da724590b0b112edb7bef766219c.png","width":807,"height":207,"width_mm":94.897,"row_group":"z20-lianmeng-2512-q14-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 14. I题图 1\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/42cf70d780b5869085b27908a7dac2ae36f198ac64aef72de9d0e56704e77d7e.png","width":267,"height":189,"width_mm":31.397,"row_group":"z20-lianmeng-2512-q14-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第14. I题图2\n（1）为使滑块甲、乙在碰撞中总动能损失较大，碰撞端应选择 （填空）。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/fb67dda24f64aeab525847b05666304010e53f4faccc5dab852c77dbf3ab9e1f.png","width":300,"height":108,"width_mm":35.278,"row_group":"z20-lianmeng-2512-q14-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\nA.\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/5a3d61320e72b6b3644730a0035d21d4d6c7848996a411b9a057aa400a7325ad.png","width":324,"height":108,"width_mm":38.1,"row_group":"z20-lianmeng-2512-q14-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\nB.\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/a4d8c2d7670503c38b5c5105c1a06e322e808007910ab4f70542f7c2dee8dea8.png","width":324,"height":111,"width_mm":38.1,"row_group":"z20-lianmeng-2512-q14-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\nC.\n（2）用螺旋测微器测量滑块甲所配遮光条的宽度，读数为 5.000mm，测量滑块乙所配遮光条的宽度，如图 2 所示，读数为 （填空）mm。\n(3) 在研究两滑块碰撞后分开的实验中, 测得滑块甲 (含遮光条) 的质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"268.5 \\mathrm{~g}"},{"type":"text","value":" , 滑块乙 (含遮光条) 的质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"175.5 \\mathrm{~g}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。现接通电源, 将滑块甲向右弹出与静止的滑块乙发生碰撞, 光电计时器获得三组挡光时间, 分别为 "},{"type":"math","value":"7.44 \\mathrm{~ms}"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"math","value":"8.95 \\mathrm{~ms}"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"math","value":"42.80 \\mathrm{~ms}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。碰撞前滑块甲对应的挡光时间为 （填空） ms, 动量是 （填空） kg·m/s (保留三位有效数字)。\n(4) 上述实验结束后, 该同学将滑块乙取走, 其余部分均保留, 如图 3 所示。调节调平螺丝,使得支脚 2 比支脚 1 高出少许, 轨道倾角 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":" 已经测出。以滑块甲及遮光条为研究对象, 仅用这套装置 （填空） (选填 “能” 或 “不能”) 完成 “验证机械能守恒定律” 实验。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/cdd71197a369762b532cfe103c155cc3ffd5709da0879c048baff07d741f70ab.png","width":963,"height":201,"width_mm":113.242,"row_group":"z20-lianmeng-2512-q14-row3"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第14. I题图3\n14. II（9分）某同学为完成电容器系列实验，准备了如下器材：一只电解电容器（标称 "},{"type":"math","value":"470\\mu \\mathrm{F}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、25V）、一块电池（标称9V）、一个定值电阻（标称 "},{"type":"math","value":"20\\mathrm{k}\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":" ）、一块灵敏电流表（量程"},{"type":"math","value":"\\pm"},{"type":"text","value":"300"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu"},{"type":"text","value":"A，内阻 "},{"type":"math","value":"2.5\\mathrm{k}\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":" ）、一块数字多用电表（选用直流 "},{"type":"math","value":"20\\mathrm{V}"},{"type":"text","value":" 档，内阻为 "},{"type":"math","value":"1\\mathrm{M}\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":" ）、一只电感（标称 "},{"type":"math","value":"470\\mu \\mathrm{H}"},{"type":"text","value":" ）、一只电压传感器及电脑、一块机械秒表、开关和导线若干。\n(1) 在 “观察电容器的充电现象” 实验中, 图 1 是准备过程中的器材及连接方式的局部照片, 除黑表笔外, 电池、开关等均已连接完毕; 图 2 是测量过程中的灵敏电流表照片, 读数为 （填空） "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu"},{"type":"text","value":"A。实验观察到, 灵敏电流表的示数开始阶段逐渐减小, 但减小到 "},{"type":"math","value":"10 \\mu \\mathrm{A}"},{"type":"text","value":" 左右就不再变化。请根据这一现象判断测量过程中黑表笔实际接触的是 （填空） (在 “−” 和 “G”) 接线柱。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/7fd52539b73b04a7d284fb35dcee7b9bfee96c50d1c93dac1807b16a4b1355a0.png","width":615,"height":372,"width_mm":72.319,"row_group":"z20-lianmeng-2512-q14-row4"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第14. II题图1\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/9442c79941d31cb5879a4510833c0